                        "sense_id": "c9add122-b99d-3ca0-bf83-425cc452220c",
                        "entry_id": "c372cc2c-f268-3ef6-ab3f-fd7459bc0e93",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Walking or wandering in the nighttime, nightwandering."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4cfa48b2-c182-4b83-8764-82012afad216",
                                "sense_id": "c9add122-b99d-3ca0-bf83-425cc452220c",
                                "text": "[…] I therefore think, Sarah, that the incommensurability of the crime with the effect, completely warrants the supersaliency of this noctivagant delinquent."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dfdade7f-afaf-4d08-a388-4e52c073fe5e",
                                "sense_id": "c9add122-b99d-3ca0-bf83-425cc452220c",
                                "text": "\"Over the city, the suburb, the slum / He rambled from pillar to post, / And backward and forward, observant, though dumb, / As a fleetly noctivagant ghost.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "522ce526-ed5f-4233-9aec-0039b77cd870",
                                "sense_id": "c9add122-b99d-3ca0-bf83-425cc452220c",
                                "text": "Unhappily, we lost the big fellow, Smirke, to noctivagant predators some days back […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "85ea07f6-6fa5-4da4-ad07-f23048d28389",
                                "sense_id": "c9add122-b99d-3ca0-bf83-425cc452220c",
                                "text": "\"Not merely nocturnal but noctivagant, a nightwalker, a prowler, a nomad of the midnight streets, attempting to abolish the distinction between the light that comes from outside and the sort that shines within.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
